  "description": "Fences is a community fork of Polly, maintained by Brighter Command. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by App vNext or the Polly maintainers. Paramore.Fences.Core is a .NET resilience and transient-fault-handling library that allows developers to express resilience strategies such as Retry, Circuit Breaker, Hedging, Timeout, Chaos and Fallback in a fluent and thread-safe manner.",
